00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:41.680
least be up front. Like, don't fake that

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:44.320
you follow them for a month or something

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:46.480
like that. Step three is that you should

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:48.839
be very specific with the outreach. So,

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.720
don't just send what a lot of people do,

00:10:48.839 --> 00:10:52.320
just say, "I love your content. Let's

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:54.600
collaborate." That won't cut it.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:57.520
Instead, you should reference a specific

00:10:54.600 --> 00:11:00.000
video or specific moment, uh a joke they

00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:01.680
made or something like that. Um so, they

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.600
actually know, "Okay, they watched the

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.920
content. They actually care about what I

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.720
do." For example, you could say

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:08.760
something like, "I really liked how you

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:11.360
made such a little detail look so

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:14.040
cinematic in that video of whatever that

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:16.160
specific product." Step four is connect

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:18.880
the dots to your product. After you show

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:21.320
that appreciation, he should see the

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:23.120
