00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.720
pay you. Make something for me." But, he

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:28.720
should see that there's an alignment

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:31.320
between the both of you. So, for me that

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:34.400
was like his audience clearly values

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:36.320
aesthetics and nice tech. and my product

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:38.520
I think was a perfect overlap for this

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:40.680
because it's minimalistic aesthetic but

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:43.240
still also has the tech heavy side with

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:45.600
the AI automations and things like that.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:47.360
Then for step five, I think this one is

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:49.640
the most important one. Um you should

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:52.000
acknowledge their value and signal

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:53.840
willingness to pay very early on. You

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.680
should really lead with making it clear

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:57.600
that you will get incentivized one way

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:59.800
or another. I think that's already sets

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:02.040
you apart from the rest and what could

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:04.120
